I'm a software engineer living in Cincinnati, OH. I'm currently working in climate tech on a data sharing platform to make energy data accessible for companies who need it. 

On weekends and evenings, I'm working on my bachelor's in computer science, and working on my [neovim plugin](https://codeberg.org/trevorhauter/gitportal.nvim) when I can. 

I'm very passionate about open source, quality software that works well for users. 

